            "title": "Trump Trade War: China Phase 1 Deal Closer Before Tariff Rise, ...",
            "snippets": [
              "Bloomberg reported that the US and China are close to an agreement on the specifics of tariff relief before they are set to rise on December 15.\n\nMarkets stocks",
              "# Forget Trump's rhetoric, phase 1 of a trade deal with China is reportedly close after all\n- **Bloomberg reported that a trade deal between the US and China is inching closer, and set to be completed before tariffs rise on December 15.**\n- **The two sides are close to agreeing the amount of tariffs to be rolled back in the \"phase one deal,\" Bloomberg said, citing people familiar with the matter. **",
